}
\description{
Make a page of the cells in both pages (intersection) or in either (union), and show it.
}
\details{
The viewer's action \code{highlight.page.combine} (Highlights). It changes the viewer's state: one step of the viewer's history, labeled as R's, undone like any other. The state it can change: \code{highlights}.
